OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam and Kate surprise Sinfield
OL,4,Aon MND run
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales
OL,7,Fsurprised Sir Kevin Sinfield as he
OL,8,Ffinished the third day of his latest
OL,9,Fendurance challenge to raise money for
OL,10,Fmotor neurone disease (MND).
OL,12,FThe Leeds Rhino legend is aiming to
OL,13,Fcomplete seven ultramarathons in seven
OL,14,Fdays, inspired by his late friend Rob
OL,15,FBurrow, who died in 2024 after living
OL,16,Fwith the disease for four years.
OL,18,FAs he arrived at the DIY Kitchens
OL,19,FStadium in Wakefield he was greeted by
OL,20,FWilliam and Kate, who stopped to chat
OL,21,Fto him and his team.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
