OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam and Kate surprise Sinfield
OL,4,Aon MND run
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliam previously "surprised" Sinfield
OL,7,Fwhen he turned up to Headingley Stadium
OL,8,Fin 2024 to present him and Burrow with
OL,9,Ftheir CBEs for services to fundraising.
